{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01472","headline":"相和歌辞 凤台曲 · 王无竞","name":"相和歌辞 凤台曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤台何逶迤，嬴女管参差。\n一旦彩云至，身去无还期。\n遗曲此台上，世人多学吹。\n一吹一落泪，至今怜玉姿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王无竞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}